<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>GlassFolders</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>GlassFolders 0.7.4 Beta 1.9</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>Beta 1.9：打开文件夹的 Clear 与 Liquid Glass 已彻底分开。Clear 只轻度混合壁纸 backdrop，Liquid Glass 使用更厚但不发黑的中性玻璃；两者都不加入紫/蓝等彩色 tint，白色只用于透光与高光。关闭文件夹继续复用原生 App 资源库分类背景视觉层，并提高其参与度。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.local.glassfolders</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>风格</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>Clear：更透明、局部模糊更轻，主要保留壁纸本身的颜色与明暗；Liquid Glass：更厚的 blur / saturation，并在深色模式加入少量中性亮度补偿，避免玻璃发黑。两种风格都会随深色/浅色模式调整白色高光强度。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSegmentCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Style</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>0</integer>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.local.glassfolders</string>
			<key>validTitles</key>
			<array>
				<string>Clear</string>
				<string>Liquid Glass</string>
			</array>
			<key>validValues</key>
			<array>
				<integer>0</integer>
				<integer>1</integer>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>玻璃强度</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>每 5% 一个档位。百分比同时控制打开与关闭文件夹的玻璃响应和白色镜面高光；Clear 与 Liquid Glass 使用不同曲线。建议先以 55% 作为基准，再按壁纸明暗微调。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>cellClass</key>
			<string>GFPercentSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>GlassStrength</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>55</integer>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.local.glassfolders</string>
			<key>min</key>
			<integer>0</integer>
			<key>max</key>
			<integer>100</integer>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<false/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>关闭文件夹的 Liquid Glass 会创建独立的 SBHLibraryCategoryPodBackgroundView，并在进入层级后触发其 _updateVisualStyle；Beta 1.9 提高了该原生视觉层的参与度。真实 App 资源库本身不会被 hook 或修改。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>应用并注销</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>respring</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>关于</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSTitleValueCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>作者</string>
			<key>get</key>
			<string>authorValue:</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
